This covers corpus.csv, blind_sample.csv, pilot_check.csv, fault_classes.json,
triggers.json, codebook.md, site_terms.md and README.md.

Attribution: Yogesh Ramaswamy (2026), corpus and codebook of “Do Chaos Experiments Match Real Cloud Incidents? Mapping 497 Public Postmortems to Fault-Injection Coverage”.

The reports themselves belong to their publishers and are not included. The corpus holds
only each report's link, its title and date as the publisher's index lists them, and
labels and short evidence notes in the author's own words.
